WEBVTT

00:00:01.184 --> 00:00:06.054
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:07.094 --> 00:00:12.554
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:29.344
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.084 --> 00:00:34.714
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.954 --> 00:00:41.224
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.764 --> 00:00:46.894
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.304 --> 00:00:50.894
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.974 --> 00:00:55.904
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.704 --> 00:01:01.044
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.784 --> 00:01:08.744
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.824 --> 00:01:14.724
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.794 --> 00:01:21.354
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:27.574
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:02:21.564 --> 00:02:22.854
Calm down.

00:02:23.224 --> 00:02:26.594
Just pretend they're a pack of
goblins and it'll be a breeze.

00:02:26.734 --> 00:02:27.064
Okay!

00:02:40.014 --> 00:02:41.534
There's no time to be
high on yourself!

00:02:44.554 --> 00:02:46.644
There's no end to this.
Where's Ovan?

00:02:46.714 --> 00:02:47.184
Not yet.

00:02:47.924 --> 00:02:51.184
Let's go to the next floor
and re-position ourselves.

00:03:18.414 --> 00:03:20.684
We're going to run
out of recovery items!

00:03:20.924 --> 00:03:22.214
Just a little longer!

00:03:22.654 --> 00:03:24.854
The enemies in front of us
are insignificant.

00:03:24.924 --> 00:03:27.794
If Ovan finds the
Key of the Twilight...

00:03:27.864 --> 00:03:28.954
...then victory is ours!

00:03:29.224 --> 00:03:29.854
Isn't that right?

00:03:29.964 --> 00:03:31.054
Exactly!

00:03:31.464 --> 00:03:34.554
Even though we're cornered,
we've still got the upper hand.

00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:40.564
Shino...

00:03:41.304 --> 00:03:42.134
It's time!

00:03:44.944 --> 00:03:45.634
I'm going.

00:03:47.114 --> 00:03:48.344
Take care of the rest.

00:03:55.884 --> 00:03:56.654
Ovan...

00:03:57.554 --> 00:03:58.044
What?

00:04:02.424 --> 00:04:03.224
Nothing.

00:04:03.994 --> 00:04:05.224
Just a little longer!

00:04:05.294 --> 00:04:06.354
Keep it up!

00:04:06.564 --> 00:04:07.434
Okay!

00:04:28.384 --> 00:04:29.754
I was waiting for you.

00:04:32.424 --> 00:04:34.484
Commence phase three.

00:04:35.164 --> 00:04:36.124
Just as I thought.

00:04:37.664 --> 00:04:39.254
This is what's it's all about.

00:04:40.094 --> 00:04:40.924
Oh?

00:04:41.234 --> 00:04:44.794
You predicted this and
yet you still came?

00:04:46.904 --> 00:04:49.504
Or are you too proud
to admit defeat?

00:04:50.074 --> 00:04:51.734
I had to come.

00:04:52.474 --> 00:04:53.444
That's why I did.

00:04:55.584 --> 00:04:56.744
That's all there is to it.

00:04:57.614 --> 00:04:59.054
That's unlike you.

00:04:59.314 --> 00:05:00.974
Or, is it?

00:05:01.924 --> 00:05:05.654
Searching for the Key
of the Twilight...

00:05:05.724 --> 00:05:09.024
...at all costs is very much like you.

00:05:09.764 --> 00:05:10.884
However...

00:05:11.094 --> 00:05:16.264
...never doubting the assumption
that the Key of the Twilight...

00:05:16.334 --> 00:05:18.034
...exists is not like you at all.

00:05:18.734 --> 00:05:20.604
The Key of the Twilight...

00:05:21.644 --> 00:05:24.834
At one time it took the form
of a forbidden bracelet.

00:05:25.344 --> 00:05:28.374
And at another time it
was the ultimate Al.

00:05:29.384 --> 00:05:34.084
You were the one who
once told me it existed.

00:05:34.984 --> 00:05:38.984
Right. We did talk
about it at one time.

00:05:39.594 --> 00:05:44.254
Not only does it have an area the system
administrator can't touch...

00:05:44.394 --> 00:05:46.994
...but it also has its own autonomy...

00:05:47.064 --> 00:05:50.054
...a mysterious game that
can change its shape.

00:05:50.534 --> 00:05:52.694
That is The World.

00:05:52.834 --> 00:05:56.574
Within it, there's an entity
that can show our universe...

00:05:56.644 --> 00:05:58.874
...the way to a better future.

00:05:58.944 --> 00:06:01.704
That is the Key of the Twilight.

00:06:02.614 --> 00:06:06.054
You also said it's the key that
will bring the twilight of dawn.

00:06:06.554 --> 00:06:07.674
That's right.

00:06:08.124 --> 00:06:12.254
That's why I prepared
this scenery for you.

00:06:14.894 --> 00:06:17.194
Twilight is the dimming
light of dusk...

00:06:17.264 --> 00:06:20.234
...and it's also the
breaking light of dawn.

00:06:22.334 --> 00:06:24.704
Ovan, have you forgotten?

00:06:25.134 --> 00:06:31.204
I also told you that the key
was lost in Revision 2.

00:06:32.574 --> 00:06:33.944
How could I forget?

00:06:34.944 --> 00:06:40.784
Still, I needed to search
for the Key of the Twilight.

00:06:42.384 --> 00:06:44.654
If it existed at one time...

00:06:44.724 --> 00:06:47.714
...there's a possibility
it still exists now.

00:06:48.964 --> 00:06:50.224
Why?

00:06:52.594 --> 00:06:54.224
That's personal.

00:07:06.644 --> 00:07:08.174
Enough talk.

00:07:14.184 --> 00:07:16.284
Haven't you heard from Ovan?

00:07:16.354 --> 00:07:18.444
You're still naïve
as usual, Sakisaka!

00:07:18.554 --> 00:07:19.114
What'd you say?!

00:07:20.394 --> 00:07:23.724
Has Ovan ever been
good at communicating?

00:07:23.794 --> 00:07:24.354
No.

00:07:24.764 --> 00:07:27.164
Why are you guys so enthusiastic?

00:07:27.234 --> 00:07:29.534
You look like you're having fun too.

00:07:29.604 --> 00:07:30.094
Huh?

00:07:33.074 --> 00:07:34.664
Shino, go upstairs.

00:07:34.974 --> 00:07:36.874
We can take care of things here.

00:07:36.944 --> 00:07:37.774
I agree.

00:07:37.844 --> 00:07:40.434
You should go check on how
things are going upstairs.

00:07:40.644 --> 00:07:43.944
But I...
Haseo, you go.

00:07:44.754 --> 00:07:47.714
It doesn't matter who,
somebody just go check on Ovan.

00:07:48.424 --> 00:07:50.824
Haseo, do what Shino says.

00:07:51.424 --> 00:07:52.554
Why me?

00:07:53.254 --> 00:07:55.094
Because you're...

00:07:56.164 --> 00:07:57.654
...Ovan's future.

00:08:02.664 --> 00:08:03.764
Go, Haseo.

00:08:17.144 --> 00:08:18.274
It's no use.

00:08:18.354 --> 00:08:20.474
You can't do anything here.

00:08:20.984 --> 00:08:24.424
Your defeat was certain as soon as
you passed through those doors.

00:08:26.594 --> 00:08:27.884
This is going to get wild!

00:08:31.994 --> 00:08:33.224
What an idiot!

00:08:34.164 --> 00:08:36.034
H-He's so cool!

00:08:36.304 --> 00:08:37.324
What?!

00:08:37.634 --> 00:08:39.194
Help me over here!

00:08:39.634 --> 00:08:41.264
See, he is an idiot!

00:08:42.544 --> 00:08:43.374
I'm going too!

00:08:50.984 --> 00:08:53.114
What are you going
to do with me?

00:08:53.354 --> 00:08:54.844
Not a thing.

00:08:54.924 --> 00:08:59.054
I'm interested in that
PC body of yours.

00:08:59.394 --> 00:09:01.154
What kind of nonsense is this?

00:09:03.264 --> 00:09:05.284
You want some lousy PC data.

00:09:05.964 --> 00:09:08.224
Don't pretend you don't know.

00:09:08.464 --> 00:09:13.264
Aren't you aware of the
size of your PC data?

00:09:14.104 --> 00:09:17.094
It's larger than a whole area.

00:09:18.574 --> 00:09:20.474
It's impossible.

00:09:20.944 --> 00:09:24.384
Exactly what did you do
to make that happen?

00:09:26.854 --> 00:09:29.614
I want to examine you thoroughly.

00:09:30.024 --> 00:09:32.784
That's been my intention all along.

00:09:40.734 --> 00:09:42.704
Ovan...

00:09:43.304 --> 00:09:46.664
I'm going to restrain
your PC body.

00:10:06.254 --> 00:10:07.784
Mission accomplished.

00:10:08.924 --> 00:10:10.324
Withdraw slowly.

00:10:26.574 --> 00:10:27.374
Ovan...

00:10:28.244 --> 00:10:29.214
Where are you?

00:10:31.714 --> 00:10:32.804
Ovan...

00:10:52.234 --> 00:10:54.764
I just gave you a little push.

00:10:54.844 --> 00:10:56.964
You were the one
who decided to go.

00:10:57.174 --> 00:10:58.874
You don't have to thank me.

00:10:59.074 --> 00:11:02.674
Yeah, but I still wanted
to show my appreciation.

00:11:04.654 --> 00:11:06.274
I guess these things happen.

00:11:06.554 --> 00:11:07.044
Huh?

00:11:07.584 --> 00:11:08.454
Haven't you heard?

00:11:08.984 --> 00:11:10.514
The rumor that...

00:11:10.584 --> 00:11:13.644
...the Twilight Brigade found
the Key of the Twilight?

00:11:14.424 --> 00:11:16.724
I hear it all even if I don't want to.

00:11:16.994 --> 00:11:18.254
Funny, isn't it?

00:11:18.694 --> 00:11:20.964
It's not true at all...

00:11:21.904 --> 00:11:25.234
...not to mention the fact
that Ovan is still missing.

00:11:25.534 --> 00:11:28.434
TaN's secret service
did put on a big show.

00:11:28.704 --> 00:11:29.364
Yeah.

00:11:30.544 --> 00:11:31.874
There's that, too.

00:11:32.474 --> 00:11:36.534
The fact that TaN had
secret operations was fully exposed.

00:11:36.614 --> 00:11:38.414
Well, anyway...

00:11:38.614 --> 00:11:40.554
...everyone who's
playing this game...

00:11:40.614 --> 00:11:44.644
...just wants a story that
makes some kind of sense.

00:11:45.554 --> 00:11:47.384
By talking about it...

00:11:47.464 --> 00:11:50.624
...it makes them feel like
they're part of the action.

00:11:50.834 --> 00:11:53.324
That's how the rumors spread.

00:11:53.894 --> 00:11:55.734
That's all there is to it.

00:11:56.134 --> 00:11:57.364
You sure keep your cool.

00:11:57.804 --> 00:12:01.334
When you get old, nothing
really comes as a surprise.

00:12:04.514 --> 00:12:05.874
It's all pretty boring.

00:12:06.244 --> 00:12:08.834
Phyllo, I think you're
wrong about that.

00:12:10.014 --> 00:12:10.944
Is that right?

00:12:11.484 --> 00:12:12.844
If you don't move...

00:12:12.914 --> 00:12:17.114
...and if you just remain here,
no surprises will come your way.

00:12:18.894 --> 00:12:21.324
You taught me that.

00:12:22.064 --> 00:12:23.994
That's why I wanted
to show my gratitude.

00:12:32.374 --> 00:12:33.134
Thank you.

00:12:43.814 --> 00:12:45.754
I'll ask you one more time.

00:12:45.884 --> 00:12:48.014
Ovan wasn't there at all?

00:12:48.384 --> 00:12:49.784
You're so annoying.

00:12:50.284 --> 00:12:51.684
You all saw it, too.

00:12:52.254 --> 00:12:54.814
There was no one
at the top floor.

00:12:55.294 --> 00:12:57.624
It's possible that you
did let him go.

00:12:58.394 --> 00:12:59.124
You kidding me?!

00:12:59.564 --> 00:13:01.054
It's too weird!

00:13:01.234 --> 00:13:02.894
Where did Ovan go?

00:13:03.234 --> 00:13:04.864
Settle down, Sakisaka.

00:13:07.474 --> 00:13:09.374
We all checked it out.

00:13:09.804 --> 00:13:13.104
There was no platform to
transport anywhere else.

00:13:13.374 --> 00:13:15.974
That place was a
complete dead end.

00:13:16.044 --> 00:13:16.674
Yeah.

00:13:17.044 --> 00:13:20.644
The only way out of there
was to reboot.

00:13:21.184 --> 00:13:25.924
And you checked for an opening
like the ones in the Cathedral...

00:13:25.994 --> 00:13:28.614
...when you disappeared
into the wall?

00:13:29.024 --> 00:13:31.184
Yeah, there
weren't any. Right?

00:13:31.294 --> 00:13:32.054
Yeah.

00:13:32.764 --> 00:13:34.254
But still...

00:13:36.364 --> 00:13:38.334
So if you think about it logically...

00:13:38.404 --> 00:13:41.394
...Ovan couldn't have
moved from there.

00:13:41.704 --> 00:13:44.004
Unfortunately, I disagree.

00:13:44.104 --> 00:13:47.444
Yeah, if he had rebooted like us...

00:13:47.514 --> 00:13:50.144
...he could've gotten
back to the town gate.

00:13:50.484 --> 00:13:52.884
That may be so, but why?

00:13:53.214 --> 00:13:54.684
Why would he do
something like that?

00:13:55.254 --> 00:13:56.584
I'd like to ask him that myself.

00:13:56.984 --> 00:13:57.974
Yeah...

00:13:58.854 --> 00:14:02.344
Maybe he wanted the
Key of the Twilight for himself...

00:14:03.064 --> 00:14:04.154
Sakisaka!

00:14:04.734 --> 00:14:06.564
Ovan's bigger than that.

00:14:07.134 --> 00:14:08.424
I think so, too.

00:14:08.664 --> 00:14:09.294
Because...

00:14:12.174 --> 00:14:15.694
Then why haven't we
heard from him yet?

00:14:16.374 --> 00:14:20.904
Maybe it's not that he
isn't contacting us...

00:14:20.984 --> 00:14:23.814
...but rather that he
wants to but can't.

00:14:25.714 --> 00:14:27.544
Let's wait a little longer.

00:14:29.324 --> 00:14:29.814
Okay?

00:14:52.014 --> 00:14:54.174
A far away memory

00:14:54.174 --> 00:14:56.144
A far away memory
Did you think I was Ovan?

00:14:56.144 --> 00:14:56.184
A far away memory

00:14:56.184 --> 00:14:56.814
A far away memory
No.

00:14:57.284 --> 00:14:57.344
Is painted on the water's surface

00:14:57.344 --> 00:14:59.414
Is painted on the water's surface
You just surprised me.

00:14:59.414 --> 00:15:01.714
Is painted on the water's surface

00:15:02.484 --> 00:15:10.724
Floating between the jade-like waves

00:15:11.734 --> 00:15:12.694
You know Ovan in the
real world, don't you?

00:15:12.694 --> 00:15:15.304
Are my warm eyelids there
You know Ovan in the
real world, don't you?

00:15:15.304 --> 00:15:17.424
Are my warm eyelids there

00:15:17.774 --> 00:15:20.304
To be opened

00:15:20.304 --> 00:15:21.004
To be opened
Yeah.

00:15:21.004 --> 00:15:23.334
To be opened

00:15:23.404 --> 00:15:28.984
Or there to be closed?

00:15:28.984 --> 00:15:32.014
Or there to be closed?
Maybe it's not my place to say...

00:15:32.014 --> 00:15:33.114
Maybe it's not my place to say...

00:15:33.114 --> 00:15:33.154
In a dream before I was born
Maybe it's not my place to say...

00:15:33.154 --> 00:15:33.484
In a dream before I was born

00:15:33.484 --> 00:15:35.424
In a dream before I was born
...but did you try to
contact him in reality.

00:15:35.424 --> 00:15:35.954
In a dream before I was born

00:15:35.954 --> 00:15:37.254
In a dream before I was born
It's useless.

00:15:37.254 --> 00:15:37.914
In a dream before I was born

00:15:38.124 --> 00:15:38.624
The place where I arrived

00:15:38.624 --> 00:15:41.424
The place where I arrived
I tried to contact him
but I got no reply.

00:15:41.424 --> 00:15:43.154
The place where I arrived

00:15:43.264 --> 00:15:44.594
Had a curtain of dim light

00:15:44.594 --> 00:15:45.494
Had a curtain of dim light
I see.

00:15:45.494 --> 00:15:48.264
Had a curtain of dim light

00:15:48.334 --> 00:15:52.934
That was gently raised

00:15:53.504 --> 00:16:04.384
Was this the day I first met you?

00:16:04.384 --> 00:16:05.184
Was this the day I first met you?
I'm sorry.

00:16:06.054 --> 00:16:06.774
Huh?

00:16:08.184 --> 00:16:10.284
I...

00:16:12.024 --> 00:16:13.324
I just have to hang tough.

00:16:13.854 --> 00:16:15.554
Shino...

00:16:15.864 --> 00:16:17.824
You're already doing that.

00:16:24.804 --> 00:16:29.634
When I returned to before I was born,

00:16:29.704 --> 00:16:35.014
My dream continued.

00:16:35.084 --> 00:16:39.914
Caressing an unforgettable voice

00:16:40.184 --> 00:16:45.054
And a cherished smile.

00:16:45.124 --> 00:16:55.804
I will climb into eternity's circle

00:16:55.804 --> 00:16:56.864
I will climb into eternity's circle
Can I stay like this for a moment?

00:16:56.864 --> 00:16:58.334
Can I stay like this for a moment?

00:17:13.454 --> 00:17:15.714
I can't handle all the complaints!

00:17:15.784 --> 00:17:17.984
You idiot! Handle them!

00:17:18.094 --> 00:17:21.754
If you can deal with the
claims you'll be a real man!

00:17:22.024 --> 00:17:23.654
Think of it as a quest!

00:17:24.064 --> 00:17:24.724
But...

00:17:24.794 --> 00:17:27.284
There's no time for
"but's" or "because's"!

00:17:27.564 --> 00:17:29.864
Those are just excuses!

00:17:29.934 --> 00:17:30.764
Enough of that!

00:17:30.834 --> 00:17:33.064
There's someone that
insists on seeing you.

00:17:33.134 --> 00:17:34.694
You're not getting the point!

00:17:34.774 --> 00:17:36.764
Someone called Shino from
the Twilight Brigade...

00:17:36.844 --> 00:17:38.274
...requests a meeting with you.

00:17:39.844 --> 00:17:41.034
The Brigade?

00:17:49.284 --> 00:17:50.384
Welcome!

00:17:50.484 --> 00:17:52.114
What is your business with TaN?

00:17:52.324 --> 00:17:55.484
I'll skip the formalities
and get right to the point.

00:17:57.594 --> 00:17:59.084
Please give Ovan back.

00:18:00.534 --> 00:18:03.194
I don't have that
kind of merchandise.

00:18:03.304 --> 00:18:05.824
Are you looking for information?

00:18:06.174 --> 00:18:09.764
I heard you are playing
the role of a merchant.

00:18:12.944 --> 00:18:14.604
What have you done with Ovan?

00:18:15.544 --> 00:18:16.244
I wonder?

00:18:16.914 --> 00:18:19.614
Are you pretending not
to know, or maybe...

00:18:19.684 --> 00:18:23.814
...they didn't tell you anything.

00:18:24.894 --> 00:18:27.884
And what do you know
about all this?

00:18:28.194 --> 00:18:32.184
Just in case, I have data
that Ovan entrusted with me...

00:18:32.634 --> 00:18:35.824
...on what TaN has done
using its secret service.

00:18:36.434 --> 00:18:39.894
Condoned by the system administrator,
this guild has been able to...

00:18:40.074 --> 00:18:41.934
...do things behind everyone's back.

00:18:42.344 --> 00:18:42.964
Wait!

00:18:44.474 --> 00:18:46.804
What do you mean,
"Condoned by the system administrator"?

00:18:47.714 --> 00:18:51.674
Oh, so you were just another
one of those being used.

00:18:52.614 --> 00:18:53.884
Please ask Naobi.

00:18:58.924 --> 00:19:01.584
I'll offer you a deal, since
you're so fond of transactions.

00:19:02.064 --> 00:19:03.994
If you give Ovan back...

00:19:04.064 --> 00:19:05.464
...I won't do anything.

00:19:07.164 --> 00:19:08.634
And if you can't do that...

00:19:08.704 --> 00:19:12.134
...the data I have on TaN...

00:19:13.634 --> 00:19:14.934
...will be made public.

00:19:15.004 --> 00:19:17.274
Well...

00:19:17.704 --> 00:19:20.074
That's not a deal.
That's a threat.

00:19:21.714 --> 00:19:24.944
Either way, I'll only
wait 12 hours.

00:19:27.654 --> 00:19:28.584
Find Naobi!

00:19:29.354 --> 00:19:32.324
And stop taking orders
until I say so!

00:19:32.594 --> 00:19:35.354
And politely cancel all the
ones you've already taken.

00:19:35.424 --> 00:19:37.394
But then...

00:19:37.524 --> 00:19:39.624
TaN is on a special
holiday as of now!

00:19:40.634 --> 00:19:42.624
Do whatever to find Naobi!

00:19:43.434 --> 00:19:45.134
Right now? Immediately?

00:19:45.374 --> 00:19:47.894
Don't ask questions when you
already know the answers.

00:19:48.004 --> 00:19:48.994
Get going!

00:19:54.244 --> 00:19:55.174
What is it?

00:19:55.244 --> 00:19:57.304
Oh, nothing much.

00:19:57.584 --> 00:19:59.314
If it's nothing, then I'm leaving.

00:19:59.384 --> 00:20:03.044
Do you think Ovan has found
the Key of the Twilight?

00:20:05.054 --> 00:20:07.784
I guess it really
doesn't matter anymore.

00:20:07.924 --> 00:20:09.154
Yeah, it does.

00:20:09.624 --> 00:20:11.394
I don't think you really cared...

00:20:11.464 --> 00:20:14.794
...if the Key of the Twilight
existed or not.

00:20:17.604 --> 00:20:21.634
Ovan gave you a
place in this game.

00:20:24.714 --> 00:20:27.644
That's the only reason
why you were searching...

00:20:27.714 --> 00:20:29.374
...for the Key of the Twilight, right?

00:20:29.814 --> 00:20:31.214
Why do you say that?

00:20:33.214 --> 00:20:36.554
It was the same for me.

00:20:37.354 --> 00:20:40.184
What was all the
"defeat Ovan" for?

00:20:40.954 --> 00:20:44.194
Only our entrance was the same,
but our exits were different.

00:20:44.694 --> 00:20:46.324
We share similarities.

00:20:47.464 --> 00:20:50.334
That's why I can understand you.

00:20:50.664 --> 00:20:53.164
Don't think it's so
easy to understand me.

00:21:01.844 --> 00:21:03.944
Ovan...

00:21:05.014 --> 00:21:06.414
I hope he returns soon.

00:21:07.454 --> 00:21:11.144
I heard the brigade is waging
an all-out war on TaN.

00:21:11.224 --> 00:21:12.344
Isn't it the other way around?

00:21:12.424 --> 00:21:14.824
Yeah, based on size it should
be the other way around.

00:21:15.064 --> 00:21:18.184
But it is the Brigade
that's waging the war.

00:21:18.394 --> 00:21:20.424
Is it the power of the
Key of the Twilight?

00:21:20.494 --> 00:21:24.194
They probably just got
fed up over something.

00:21:25.134 --> 00:21:27.294
It seems the girl
from the Brigade...

00:21:27.374 --> 00:21:28.994
...gave the administrator data...

00:21:29.074 --> 00:21:32.844
...that proves that TaN has been
involved in illegal activities.

00:21:33.544 --> 00:21:36.674
So, that's what Ovan
had up his sleeve.

00:21:36.844 --> 00:21:39.844
That might actually
make things easier.

00:21:40.214 --> 00:21:40.654
Hm?

00:21:41.624 --> 00:21:44.114
Because TaN is no longer
needed now.

00:21:44.584 --> 00:21:45.854
That's true.

00:21:47.154 --> 00:21:50.214
It simplifies things
if TaN is disbanded...

00:21:50.294 --> 00:21:52.024
...because of illegal activities.

00:21:52.334 --> 00:21:55.994
This PC body will become
useless pretty soon.

00:21:56.734 --> 00:22:01.764
I never felt an attachment to
this PC in the first place.

00:22:04.604 --> 00:22:05.074
Yes.

00:22:06.014 --> 00:22:07.674
Well, then...

00:22:07.944 --> 00:22:10.474
...I'll continue examining Ovan.

00:22:30.134 --> 00:22:33.734
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.804 --> 00:22:37.244
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.504 --> 00:22:40.914
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:40.974 --> 00:22:45.344
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.854 --> 00:22:52.444
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.524 --> 00:22:56.154
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.224 --> 00:23:03.464
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.534 --> 00:23:07.194
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.274 --> 00:23:10.964
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:11.044 --> 00:23:17.974
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.154 --> 00:23:21.884
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.954 --> 00:23:24.974
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:25.054 --> 00:23:32.514
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.764 --> 00:23:35.964
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:36.034 --> 00:23:40.064
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.174 --> 00:23:43.764
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.844 --> 00:23:47.404
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.474 --> 00:23:51.214
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.284 --> 00:23:55.044
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:56.324 --> 00:23:59.294
Next Episode...
